{"4148760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "マギアリーナ(MagiArena)", "steam_appid": 4148760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >『Magical Arena』</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute SD characters battle on the field in turn-based command combat!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponents with swords and magic!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Conditions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deplete all enemy characters' HP to zero to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path to Victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Essence System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some role skills grant “Magic Essence”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two matching Magic Essences appear on the field, special effects activate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effects include ‘Massive Damage’, ‘Slip Damage’, and debuffs like ‘Defense Down’!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When and which Magic Essences will you activate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battles, choose 3 characters from 4 types to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the same character multiple times!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your unique combination...!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >『Magical Arena』</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute SD characters battle on the field in turn-based command combat!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponents with swords and magic!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Conditions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deplete all enemy characters' HP to zero to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path to Victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Essence System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some role skills grant “Magic Essence”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two matching Magic Essences appear on the field, special effects activate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effects include ‘Massive Damage’, ‘Slip Damage’, and debuffs like ‘Defense Down’!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When and which Magic Essences will you activate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battles, choose 3 characters from 4 types to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the same character multiple times!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your unique combination...!</p>", "short_description": "Magical Arena is a 3v3 command-based game. The key feature is the ‘Magic Element System,’ where combining two elements triggers various effects. The core fun lies in strategizing which Magic Element effects to activate based on your tactics.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148760/762c66bbdac2aa4cb734ec552a5449503200550a/header.jpg?t=1773386036", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148760/248de49542f411b925d9a0808e93eb4c6dfa2499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773386036", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148760/248de49542f411b925d9a0808e93eb4c6dfa2499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177